---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { orderTerms, coreOrderPolicy, coreOrderProducts } from '../ordering.mjs';
---
<Layout title="Packaging MOQ, Samples & Delivery | Welltroy" description="Compare Welltroy core packaging materials, closures and MOQ 500 pieces. Confirm quantity breakdown, artwork, sample timing and shipping before production." canonicalPath="/ordering/">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Ordering &amp; delivery</div><p class="eyebrow">Buying from Welltroy</p><h1>A Clear Path to Your Packaging Order</h1><p class="lead">Start with the product and destination. Confirm the specification, sample route, payment milestones and delivery terms in writing before production.</p><div class="anchor-links"><a href="#minimum-order">Core products &amp; MOQ</a><a href="#samples">Samples</a><a href="#payment">Payment</a><a href="#delivery">Delivery</a><a href="#quality">Quality queries</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container policy-content">
    <h2 id="minimum-order">Core Packaging Materials, Closures and Minimum Orders</h2>
    <p><strong>{coreOrderPolicy.summary}</strong> {coreOrderPolicy.breakdown} {coreOrderPolicy.configuration}</p>
    <p>The table describes the supply range, rather than stock availability or an approved specification for every size. Choose a product, then confirm the usable size, material, closure, artwork and quantity together.</p>
    <p class="table-scroll-hint">Swipe or scroll to compare product and order details.</p><div class="table-wrap" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="Core packaging specification and minimum orders"><table><caption>Core packaging order reference — updated 7 November 2026</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Product</th><th scope="col">Material &amp; closure</th><th scope="col">MOQ &amp; details to confirm</th></tr></thead><tbody>{coreOrderProducts.map(product => <tr><th scope="row"><a href={'/products/' + product.slug + '/'}>{product.name}</a></th><td><p>{product.material}</p><p>{product.closure}</p></td><td><strong>{coreOrderPolicy.pieces} pieces</strong><p>{product.check}</p><a class="text-link" href={'/quote/?product=' + product.slug + '#quote-form'} data-quote-placement="content">Quote this product →</a></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
    <p><strong>Other products use their own sales units and minimums.</strong> Honeycomb paper starts at 1 roll (1 pc). Confirm the roll or fanfold configuration for thermal labels; other paper and pouch ranges are quoted by their own specifications.</p>
    <h3>What Does a 500-Piece Enquiry Need?</h3><p>Send packed-item dimensions with units, proposed bag size or a request for sizing advice, quantity by product and design, material and closure preferences, logo files and destination. A request for 250 pieces in each of two designs is a proposed split to review, not an approved production offer.</p>
    <p>For garment inner and outer bags, list each product separately. Use the <a href="/guides/apparel-inner-bags-and-shipping-mailers/#finish-and-closure">frosted/clear garment selection guide</a> and <a href="/guides/custom-packaging-500-pieces/#total-cost">itemized quote checklist</a> to prepare a comparable brief.</p>
    <h3>Design Draft and Final Artwork</h3><p>{orderTerms.design}</p><p>Prepare a PDF or PSD for upload. For EPS artwork, email <a href="mailto:info@welltroy.com">info@welltroy.com</a> or export a PDF for the enquiry form. Confirm the print template and final proof using the <a href="/guides/logo-artwork-checklist/#submit-artwork">artwork submission checklist</a>.</p>
    <h2 id="samples">Choose Your Sample Route</h2><div class="grid-2"><article class="editorial-card"><h3>Existing product sample</h3><p>Useful for checking the available material, construction, closure and approximate size. Tell us which product you would like to assess.</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><h3>Custom printed sample</h3><p>Useful for reviewing your artwork and specification. Send your logo, size, colors and material requirements so we can confirm the sample route.</p></article></div><p>{orderTerms.sample}</p><p><strong>Before dispatch:</strong> confirm which sample is included, any artwork or setup requirements, and who pays the courier charge. A free sample does not automatically mean free delivery.</p>
    <p>Before approving a custom sample, use the <a href="/guides/custom-mailer-sample-approval/">mailer and garment bag sample approval checklist</a> to record fit, artwork, closure and the final reference. For clothing inner bags, use the <a href="/guides/custom-mailer-sample-approval/#garment-sample-trial">slider-bag checks</a> and <a href="/downloads/garment-bag-sample-approval.txt" download>blank garment sample record (TXT)</a>.</p>
    <h2 id="payment">30% Deposit · 70% Balance</h2><p>{orderTerms.payment}</p><p>Your quotation should identify the invoicing company, currency, total amount, payment milestones and bank beneficiary. Verify payment details with your established Welltroy contact before transferring funds, especially if any account details change.</p>
    <h2>Approve the Specification</h2><ul class="check-list"><li>Product model, dimensions and usable space</li><li>Material, thickness or paper weight and closure</li><li>Artwork, printing colors and approval reference</li><li>Quantity per design, packing and carton information</li><li>Inspection requirements and agreed acceptance criteria</li></ul><p>Need a particular test report, food-contact document or environmental specification? Include the exact product, intended use and destination market in your enquiry.</p>
    <h2 id="delivery">Production and Delivery Are Separate</h2><p>{orderTerms.production}</p><p>For a delivery quotation, include your country, postcode or port and required arrival date. Ask us to specify the available shipping method, dispatch estimate, transit estimate and whether the price includes freight, import duties and taxes. Arrival timing depends on the route and customs clearance.</p>
    <h2 id="quality">Raise a Quality Query</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:info@welltroy.com">info@welltroy.com</a> with your order reference, affected quantity, photos or video, and the agreed specification. Keep the affected goods and packaging available for review. For transit damage, include photos of the outer cartons and shipping labels.</p><p>Confirm inspection arrangements, reporting deadlines and remedies in your written order terms before ordering. Custom orders are reviewed against their agreed specification.</p>
    <p>For receiving checks, use the <a href="/guides/bulk-packaging-arrival-inspection/">bulk packaging arrival inspection checklist</a> and <a href="/downloads/bulk-packaging-arrival-inspection.txt" download>blank inspection record (TXT)</a> to record the affected order version, carton and findings.</p>
    <p>After receiving a proposal, use the <a href="/guides/compare-custom-mailer-quotes/">mailer and garment bag quote comparison worksheet</a> to confirm specification, cost items and delivery scope. For an apparel pack, use the <a href="/guides/compare-custom-mailer-quotes/#garment-quotes">inner-and-outer comparison</a> and <a href="/downloads/garment-inner-outer-quote-comparison.txt" download>blank comparison record (TXT)</a>.</p>
    <h2>Your Enquiry, Then Your Quotation</h2><p>Submitting the website form requests a quotation; it does not place an order or take payment. We reply using the email address you provide. Include any deadline in your message, or contact us on WhatsApp for a time-sensitive request.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/quote/#quote-form">Prepare an enquiry</a><a class="text-link" href="/catalogue/">View the current product guide →</a></div>
  </div></section>
</Layout>

<style>
  #quality {
    scroll-margin-block-start: calc(var(--header-height, 80px) + 16px);
  }
</style>

<style>.policy-content{min-width:0}.policy-content table{min-width:760px}.policy-content table th,.policy-content table td{vertical-align:top}.policy-content table p{margin:0 0 10px}.policy-content table th[scope="row"]{width:23%}.policy-content h2[id]{scroll-margin-top:110px}</style>
